### Get one event by slug
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events/cloud-next-2027
Accept: application/json

### Get all events
GET http://localhost:3000/api/events
Accept: application/json

### Create an event
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Cloud Next 2026
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Google’s premier cloud computing event, showcasing innovations in AI, infrastructure, and enterprise solutions.
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="overview"

Cloud Next 2026 highlights the latest in cloud-native development, Kubernetes, AI, and enterprise scalability.
Developers, architects, and executives gather to learn about new Google Cloud services, best practices, and success stories.
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="event1.webp"

< /Users/michaelcherrera/Development/Practice/NextJS/nextjs-crash-course/public/images/event1.png
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="venue"

Moscone Center
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="location"

San Francisco, CA
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="date"

2026-04-10
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="time"

08:30
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="mode"

hybrid
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audience"

Cloud engineers, DevOps, enterprise leaders, AI researchers
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="agenda"

[
  "08:30 AM - 09:30 AM | Keynote: AI-Driven Cloud Infrastructure",
  "09:45 AM - 11:00 AM | Deep Dives: Kubernetes, Data Analytics, Security",
  "11:15 AM - 12:30 PM | Product Demos & Networking",
  "12:30 PM - 01:30 PM | Lunch",
  "01:30 PM - 03:00 PM | Workshops: Scaling with GCP",
  "03:15 PM - 04:30 PM | Fireside Chat: The Future of Enterprise Cloud"
]
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="organizer"

Google Cloud organizes Cloud Next to connect global businesses, developers, and innovators with the latest technologies and best practices in cloud computing.
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tags"

[
  "Cloud",
  "DevOps",
