### Create 2nd event
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

AWS re:Invent 2026
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Amazon Web Services' flagship conference focused on cloud computing, DevOps, and scalable infrastructure.
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="overview"

AWS re:Invent 2026 brings together developers, engineers, and business leaders to explore the latest in cloud infrastructure, serverless computing, AI, and DevOps practices.
Attendees gain hands-on experience with AWS tools and learn how to build scalable, resilient systems.
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="event2.webp"

