### Create 3rd event
POST http://localhost:3000/api/events
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

KubeCon + CloudNativeCon 2026
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

The leading conference for Kubernetes and cloud-native technologies.
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="overview"

KubeCon + CloudNativeCon 2026 gathers the cloud-native community to discuss Kubernetes, microservices, and modern DevOps practices.
Engineers and open-source contributors collaborate on scaling distributed systems and advancing cloud-native ecosystems.
--WebAppBoundary
